{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103614","id":2372748512,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6NbUTg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103614","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103614.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103614.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103614","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103614/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103614/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103614/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/54626de2dbabd1178dbc929a3d8b82e7c52899a6","number":103614,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rendering: SPIR-V reflection incorrectly determined `writable` state","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Identified from testing #101696\r\n\r\nResolves a bug in `RenderingDeviceDriver::_reflect_spirv`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1af1edf60c1c317f6953c4fa78e0743a0729704d/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.cpp#L163-L167\r\n\r\nWhen reflecting an image type, the `binding.block` struct is _invalid_, as that only applies to `struct` types. Here is the dumped value of the `binding` variable from the debugger, abbreviated:\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  spirv_id = 65\r\n  name = 0x000000011c28fd80 \"current_image\"\r\n  binding = 0\r\n  input_attachment_index = 0\r\n  set = 0\r\n  descriptor_type = SPV_REFLECT_DESCRIPTOR_TYPE_STORAGE_IMAGE\r\n  resource_type = SPV_REFLECT_RESOURCE_FLAG_UAV\r\n  image = (dim = SpvDim2D, depth = 0, arrayed = 0, ms = 0, sampled = 2, image_format = SpvImageFormatR32f)\r\n  block = {\r\n    spirv_id = 0\r\n    name = 0x0000000000000000\r\n    offset = 0\r\n    absolute_offset = 0\r\n    size = 0\r\n    padded_size = 0\r\n    decoration_flags = 0\r\n    flags = 0\r\n    member_count = 0\r\n    members = nullptr\r\n    type_description = nullptr\r\n    word_offset = (offset = 0)\r\n  }\r\n  count = 1\r\n  accessed = 1\r\n  uav_counter_id = 4294967295\r\n  uav_counter_binding = nullptr\r\n  byte_address_buffer_offset_count = 0\r\n  byte_address_buffer_offsets = 0x0000000000000000\r\n  type_description = 0x000000011c295470\r\n  word_offset = (binding = 175, set = 171)\r\n  decoration_flags = 128\r\n  user_type = SPV_REFLECT_USER_TYPE_INVALID\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that the the entire `binding.block` struct is `0`, which means this will evaluate to `true`, as the second part of the expression does not have the `SPV_REFLECT_DECORATION_NON_WRITABLE` bit set, as it is invalid and always `0`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nuniform.writable = !(binding.type_description->decoration_flags & SPV_REFLECT_DECORATION_NON_WRITABLE) && !(binding.block.decoration_flags & SPV_REFLECT_DECORATION_NON_WRITABLE);\r\n```\r\n\r\nMetal has its own implementation to reflect the SPIR-V, which distinguishes the types:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d89cc01e0028e9dff488cdf768f62fdf31b1743e/drivers/metal/rendering_device_driver_metal.mm#L1787-L1796\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> SPIR-V cross throws an exception if you try to fetch the block metadata for an image.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-05T07:00:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T21:45:22Z","closed_at":"2025-05-29T19:29:58Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"stuartcarnie:reflect_spirv_fix","ref":"reflect_spirv_fix","repo":{"id":702688448,"node_id":"R_kgDOKeIswA","name":"godot","full_name":"stuartcarnie/godot","owner":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptio